  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agriculture programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;b&gt; Agri&lt;/b&gt; stands for Agriculture programme and it contributes to the support of Support Rwanda in its transformation to a well governed, climate resilient and inclusive welfare state. The programme has 2 main objectives : (1) improve climate friendly extension, training and business services and an enabling environment for (future) producers and SME&#xb4;s to produce quality food and earn a decent income and (2) improve the food environment and reaching consumers to improve quality and sustainable diets, all to contribute to improvements in food and nutrition security, social and economic equality and environmental sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
